==Russian==

===Prefix===
'''под-''', {{lang|ru|[[подо-]]}} (pod-, podo-)

# {{cx|used with verbs|lang=ru}} [[upwards]] {{gloss|describing an action of moving from the bottom up}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[бро́сить]]|''(pf.)'' to throw|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подбро́сить]]|''(pf.)'' to throw upwards|inline=y}}
# {{cx|used with verbs|lang=ru}} [[closer]] {{gloss|describing an action of approaching to an entity}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[идти́]]|''(impf.)'' to go (by walking)|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подойти́]]|''(pf.)'' to walk up to, to approach (by walking)|inline=y}}
# {{cx|used with verbs|lang=ru}} [[adding]] {{gloss|describing an action of adding more entity}}
#:* {{ux|ru|бавить|an archaic [[causative]] form of [[быть]] that depends on verbal prefixes in contemporary usage|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подба́вить]]|''(pf.)'' to add, replenish|inline=y}}
# {{cx|used with verbs|lang=ru}} {{gloss|describing a meaning, for imperfect verbs, that shows a finished action or an obtainment of a result}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[стричь]]|''(impf.)'' to cut|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подстри́чь]]|''(pf.)'' to cut|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[писа́ть]]|''(impf.)'' to write|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подписа́ть]]|''(pf.)'' to sign, to subscribe (in the sense of writing one's name with a result)|inline=y}}
# {{cx|used with verbs|lang=ru}} {{gloss|describing an action of copying or following someone's action}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[да]]|yes|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подда́кивать]]|''(impf.)'' to say yes, assent (in the sense echoing "yes")|inline=y}}
# {{cx|used with verbs|lang=ru}} {{gloss|describing an existence of the certain action that is weak, invisible, hidden or incomplete}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[уста́ть]]|''(pf.)'' to get tired|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подуста́ть]]|''(pf.)'' to get tired slightly or lightly|inline=y}}

===Prefix===
'''под-''', {{lang|ru|[[подо-]]}} (pod-, podo-)

# {{cx|used with nouns|lang=ru}} {{gloss|resulting in nouns or adjectives; describing an existence of being under or beneath something}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[земля́]]|ground|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подзе́мный]]|underground|inline=y}}
# {{cx|used with nouns|lang=ru}} [[sub]]
#:* {{ux|ru|[[гру́ппа]]|group|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подгру́ппа]]|subgroup|inline=y}}
# {{cx|used with nouns|lang=ru}} {{gloss|resulting in nouns or adjectives; describing an influence under something}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[власть]]|authority, control|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подвла́стный]]|subjected, dependant|inline=y}}
# {{cx|used with nouns|lang=ru}} {{gloss|resulting in nouns or adjectives; describing an existence of being around something}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[Карпа́ты]]|[[Carpathians]] (mountains)|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[Подкарпа́тский]]|Subcarpathian (cf. Подкарпатье / Subcarpathia)|inline=y}}
# {{cx|used with nouns|lang=ru}} {{gloss|resulting in nouns; describing an title or position below the superior}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[ма́стер]]|master|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подмасте́рье]]|apprentice|inline=y}}
# {{cx|used with adjectives|lang=ru}} {{gloss|adverbs; describing completeness}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[чи́стый]]|clean|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подчисту́ю]]|without remainder|inline=y}}

====Usage notes====
* In the meaning of ''closer'', only use под- when the subject is in the sight range of the object of interest, and then moves even closer towards it.
: ''Я подошла к памятнику.''
::I walked up to the statue. (I already was in the same room or space with it, and then walked closer to it.)
: ''Я {{lang|ru|[[прийти|пришла]]}} к памятнику.''
::I arrived at the statue. (I came to the statue from somewhere further.)

